# The web presence is not game content.
#
# Without this, Godot imports web/landing/assets/*.jpg as game textures: it
# writes .import files next to them and packs 1.2MB of marketing photography
# into the .pck that players download. The landing page serves those files
# directly over HTTP and never through res://.
#
# The generated game export lives under web/game/ and is deliberately inside an
# ignored folder too, so an export can never be re-imported as source.
